OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts to remove nine city
OL,4,Alampposts amid row
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have challenged the
OL,7,Fevidence used to justify the removal of
OL,8,Fnine historic lamp posts in Canterbury,
OL,9,Fas work begins to dismantle the
OL,10,Fstructures.
OL,12,FKent County Council (KCC) said work
OL,13,Fwill start on Tuesday to replace the
OL,14,Fcolumns in Cossington Road after they
OL,15,Ffailed safety checks.
OL,17,FDave Wilson, chair of the Canterbury
OL,18,FSociety, said the group did not believe
OL,19,FKCC had carried out all the
OL,20,Finvestigations required to justify the
OL,21,Fmove.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
