OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts to remove nine city
OL,4,Alampposts amid row
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Osborne, KCC's cabinet member for
OL,7,Fhighways and transport, said he
OL,8,Funderstood some may be disappointed but
OL,9,Fthat the local authority "has a
OL,10,Fresponsibility to act when assessments
OL,11,Fidentify a risk to public safety".
